---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import NavbarEn from '@/components/NavbarEn.astro';
import FooterEn from '@/components/FooterEn.astro';

const seo = {
  "title": "Privacy policy - Innovorder",
  "description": "Privacy policy and treatment of personal data on the site www.innovorder.fr",
  "lang": "en",
  "htmlAttrs": {
    "data-wf-page": "6493777d655aea5e6643cc88"
  },
  "bodyClass": "body",
  "webflowScripts": [
    {
      "src": "/assets/d3e54v103j8qbb.cloudfront.net/js/jquery-3.5.1.min.dc5e7f18c8.js",
      "type": "text/javascript",
      "integrity": "sha256-9/aliU8dGd2tb6OSsuzixeV4y/faTqgFtohetphbbj0=",
      "crossorigin": "anonymous"
    },
    {
      "src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/js/webflow.schunk.4621b44054c4cc64.js",
      "type": "text/javascript",
      "integrity": "sha384-aghwvml5rig/T7e4zosxno6oA1Egc3cKPM6FP9ti9TCQkAoo+GH+XXh7xNn/M+6r",
      "crossorigin": "anonymous"
    },
    {
      "src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/js/webflow.schunk.b693920686705a26.js",
      "type": "text/javascript",
      "integrity": "sha384-C/wFs2yjYA9jOcYLm4wK5l9pvcKosdzrrEqod/82XTjVD5Sa5FyXRmbPrHN7uuct",
      "crossorigin": "anonymous"
    },
    {
      "src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc59779719f99c/js/webflow.81c8caa2.7a583d2f84404f74.js",
      "type": "text/javascript",
      "integrity": "sha384-DJVlwW9hLkiHqUOtjKtqn5a4YlqRnDc0Qur0U7MOnZJttoySvb0C7QVV3p98mPpb",
      "crossorigin": "anonymous"
    }
  ],
  "alternates": {
    "fr": "https://www.innovorder.com/privacy-policy",
    "en": "https://www.innovorder.com/en/politique-de-confidentialite"
  }
};
---
<BaseLayout {...seo}>
  <div class="layout"><div class="gtm-embed w-embed"></div><NavbarEn /><div class="section-hero container bottom-padding">
      <h1 data-w-id="26b5431f-9769-58b8-a623-f13d5719b2d3" class="title-1">Privacy Policy<br></h1>
      <div class="rich-text-block w-richtext">
        <p>This Privacy Policy explains how Innovorder S.A.S. uses the personal data we collect from you when you use our website.<br></p>
        <p><strong>Topics: </strong><br></p>
        <ul role="list">
          <li>What data do we collect?</li>
          <li>How do we collect your data?</li>
          <li>How do we use your data?</li>
          <li>How do we store your data?</li>
          <li>Marketing</li>
          <li>What are your data protection rights?</li>
          <li>What are cookies?</li>
          <li>How do we use cookies?</li>
          <li>What types of cookies do we use?</li>
          <li>How to manage your cookies</li>
          <li>Privacy Policies of Other Websites</li>
          <li>Changes to our privacy policy</li>
          <li>How to contact us ? </li>
          <li>How to contact the competent authorities?</li>
        </ul>
        <p><br></p>
        <p><strong>What data do we collect?</strong></p>
        <p>Our company collects the following data:</p>
        <ul role="list">
          <li>Personally identifiable information (Name, e-mail address, phone number, etc.).</li>
        </ul>
        <p><br></p>
        <p><strong>How do we collect your data?</strong></p>
        <p>You provide most of the data we collect directly to Innovorder. We collect and process data when you:</p>
        <ul role="list">
          <li>You register online or fill out a form for one of our products or services.</li>
          <li>You voluntarily complete a customer survey or provide feedback on one of our bulletin boards or via email.</li>
          <li>Use or view our website via your browser's cookies.<br></li>
        </ul>
        <p><br></p>
        <p><strong>How do we use your data?</strong></p>
        <p>Our company collects your data in order to:</p>
        <ul role="list">
          <li>Process your order, manage your account.</li>
          <li>Send you special offers on other products and services that we think you might like by e-mail.<br></li>
        </ul>
        <p><br></p>
        <p>When our company processes your request, it may send your data to credit reference agencies and use the resulting information to prevent you from making fraudulent purchases.</p>
        <p>‍<br></p>
        <p><strong>How do we store your data?</strong></p>
        <p>‍</p>
        <p>Our Company stores your data securely in the OVHcloud data centers.<br></p>
        <p>Our Company will keep your name, email and phone number for a period of 2 years. Once this period is over, your data will be automatically deleted.</p>
        <p>‍<br></p>
        <p><strong>Marketing</strong></p>
        <p>Our company would like to send you information about our products and services that may be of interest to you, as well as those of our partners.</p>
        <ul role="list">
          <li>Deligo</li>
          <li>Greengo deposit</li>
          <li>Pop Chef</li>
        </ul>
        <p><br></p>
        <p>If you have agreed to receive marketing, you can always opt out at a later date.</p>
        <p>‍<br></p>
        <p>You have the right at any time to prevent Our Company from contacting you for marketing purposes or sharing your data with other members of the Our Company group.</p>
        <p>‍<br></p>
        <p>If you no longer wish to be contacted for marketing purposes, please send an email to marketing@innovorder.fr</p>
        <p>‍<br></p>
        <p><strong>What are your data protection rights?</strong></p>
        <p>Innovorder wants to make sure that you are fully aware of all your data protection rights. Each user has the following rights:</p>
        <p>‍<br><strong>The right of access </strong>- You have the right to request copies of your personal data from Innovorder. We may charge you a small fee for this service.<br></p>
        <p><strong>Right to correct your data - </strong>You have the right to ask Innovorder to correct any information that you believe to be inaccurate. You also have the right to request that our company complete any information that you believe is incomplete.</p>
        <p><strong>The right to deletion of personal data </strong>- You have the right to request Innovorder to delete your personal data, under certain conditions<strong>.‍</strong></p>
        <p><strong>The right to restrict the processing of your data </strong>- You have the right to request Innovorder to restrict the processing of your personal data, under certain conditions.<br>‍</p>
        <p><strong>The right to object to the processing of your personal data</strong> - You have the right to object to the processing of your personal data by Innovorder, under certain conditions.<br></p>
        <p><br></p>
        <p><strong>The right to data portability</strong><strong> </strong>- You have the right to request that Innovorder transfer the data we have collected to another organization, or directly to you, under certain conditions.</p>
        <p><br></p>
        <p>If you expressly request it, our teams have a period of 1 month to respond to your request. If you wish to exercise any of these rights, please contact us at our e-mail address :</p>
        <p>Call us : <strong>+33 1 86 95 49 83</strong></p>
        <p>Or write to us: marketing@innovorder.fr</p>
        <p><br></p>
        <p><strong>What are cookies?</strong></p>
        <p>‍</p>
        <p>Cookies are text files placed on your computer to collect standard Internet log information and visitor behavior. When you visit our websites, we may automatically collect information about you through cookies or similar technologies.</p>
        <p>‍<br></p>
        <p>For more information, visit: aIIaboutcookies.org.</p>
        <p><br></p>
        <p><strong>How do we use cookies?</strong></p>
        <p>Our company uses cookies in a variety of ways to enhance your experience on our website, including:</p>
        <ul role="list">
          <li>Maintain your connection</li>
          <li>Understanding how you use our website</li>
          <li>[Add your company's uses of cookies].</li>
        </ul>
        <p>‍<br></p>
        <p><strong>What types of cookies do we use?</strong></p>
        <p>There are a number of different types of cookies, however, our website uses:</p>
        <ul role="list">
          <li><strong>Functionality</strong> - Innovorder uses these cookies to recognize you on our website and to remember your previously selected preferences. These may include your preferred language and location. A mixture of first-party and third-party cookies are used.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>‍</p>
        <ul role="list">
          <li><strong>Advertising </strong>- Innovorder uses these cookies to collect information about your visit to our website, the content you viewed, the links you followed and information about your browser, device and IP address. Our company sometimes shares limited aspects of this data with third parties for advertising purposes. We may also share online data collected through cookies with our advertising partners. This means that when you visit another website, you may be shown advertisements based on your browsing habits on our website.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><br></p>
        <p><strong>How to manage cookies</strong></p>
        <p>You can set your browser not to accept cookies. The website above tells you how to delete cookies from your browser. However, in some cases, some of the features of our website may not work as a result.<br></p>
        <p>‍</p>
        <p><strong>Privacy Policies of Other Websites</strong></p>
        <p>The Innovorder website contains links to other websites. Our privacy policy applies only to our website, so if you click on a link to another website, you should read its privacy policy.</p>
        <p>‍<br></p>
        <p><strong>Changes to our privacy policy</strong></p>
        <p>Our company regularly reviews its privacy policy and posts any updates on this web page. This privacy policy was last updated on May 20, 2022.</p>
        <p>‍<br></p>
        <p><strong>How to contact us</strong></p>
        <p>If you have any questions about Innovorder's privacy policy, the data we hold about you, or if you wish to exercise any of your data protection rights, please contact us.<br></p>
        <p>Send us an email at the following address: marketing@innovorder.fr</p>
        <p>Call us : <strong>+33 1 86 95 49 83</strong></p>
        <p><strong>‍</strong><br></p>
        <p><strong>How to contact the competent authority</strong></p>
        <p>‍</p>
        <p>If you wish to file a complaint or if you feel that Innovorder has not responded to your concern in a satisfactory manner, you can contact our human resources department.<br></p>
        <p>Email: rh@innovorder.fr</p>
      </div>
    </div><FooterEn /></div>
</BaseLayout>
